  "id": "affective-tone",
  "term": "affective tone",
  "definition": "Affective tone, or feeling tone, is the feeling element that accompanies a mental state. In historical psychology, the term was used for qualitative differences in feeling, while pleasure and pain were better treated separately as hedonic tone.",
